'm basically doing everything myself.","nextNodeIds":[718240104]},{"nodeId":718240104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":220401,"speakerName":"Smiley Yanxiao","textMapHash":2416509570,"text":"We're not getting too many guests, though, so things aren't too bad. I can still handle it.","nextNodeIds":[718240105]},{"nodeId":718240105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":220401,"speakerName":"Smiley Yanxiao","textMapHash":462793594,"text":"*cough* Also, I should thank you for helping me previously. If it hadn't been for your help, I don't think I'd ever have been able to return to work...","nextNodeIds":[718240106,718240107]},{"nodeId":718240106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1959231506,"text":"Ah. So recently...","nextNodeIds":[718240108]},{"nodeId":718240108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":220401,"speakerName":"Smiley Yanxiao","textMapHash":1617613586,"text":"N—No! Definitely not, believe me! I—If she were to show up again, I d—don't know if my heart could take it...","nextNodeIds":[718240109]},{"nodeId":718240109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":220401,"speakerName":"Smiley Yanxiao","textMapHash":2793535418,"text":"If you really want to ask about... her... you should just go ask the boss. I—I don't know anything, I swear...","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":718240107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1648398618,"text":"So, has she...","nextNodeIds":[718240108]}]},{"talkId":7182404,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":false,"he